special_description = "His Slime Spear (a long, sharp spear of slime) arcs like a throw, and a press while it flies recalls it straight back through anyone in the way. Hits leave Predator Marks (three in a row burst for 12; a miss wipes them) and build Adaptation: each stack (up to 3) adds 3% to his basic throws and takes 4% off every hit he takes; a miss fades one. Beelzebuth throws a black orb that opens a devouring vortex, dragging the enemy in, eating their shield and marks, then collapsing for 30. Predator: when it hits, he devours their weapon and throws it at once as a free extra throw, 5% harder (not when Kyoka Suigetsu turns it on him). Slime Regeneration: the first blow that would knock him out leaves him on 1 HP, free of every ailment. Below 40 HP he becomes the Shadow Sovereign, rising on great wings in his cracked mask: faster Gluttony's Maw blades (20), three marks snap shut for 20 and heal him 3, Adaptation goes to 4 stacks (+4% basic damage and 5% less damage taken each), three basic hits in a row arm Gluttony to devour the enemy's next basic throw as it nears him, and Beelzebuth hits for 40. Fatality: Imaginary Space.
"
price = 1000
rarity = &"mythic"
